---

<!-- Editorial statement — a typographic beat between the trust strip and the services grid. -->
<section class="relative overflow-hidden bg-white py-20 lg:py-28">
  <div
    aria-hidden="true"
    class="absolute -top-24 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 w-[640px] h-[420px] rounded-full bg-gradient-to-br from-amber-200/40 via-orange-200/20 to-transparent blur-3xl pointer-events-none"
  ></div>

  <div class="relative max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 text-center">
    <div data-reveal>
      <span class="chip bg-amber-50 text-amber-700 border border-amber-200">
        <span class="chip-dot"></span>
        Why This Matters
      </span>

      <h2 class="mt-6 text-4xl sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-black text-gray-900 leading-[1.1] tracking-tight">
        Most AI initiatives clear the demo.<br />
        Few clear <span class="text-brand">the audit</span>.
      </h2>

      <p class="mt-6 text-lg lg:text-xl text-gray-600 max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">
        I've spent 15+ years building the cloud, MLOps, and governance layers that turn a
        working prototype into a platform your compliance team will actually sign off on —
        without the overhead of a big consultancy. It's the same gap I now teach
        experienced DevOps and platform engineers to close as they become AI platform
        engineers.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div
      data-reveal
      class="mt-14 grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 divide-y sm:divide-y-0 sm:divide-x divide-gray-200 max-w-3xl mx-auto"
    >
      <div class="py-4 sm:py-0 sm:px-6">
        <div class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-gray-400">Cost</div>
        <div class="mt-2 text-lg font-bold text-gray-900">30% average cloud cost reduction</div>
      </div>
      <div class="py-4 sm:py-0 sm:px-6">
        <div class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-gray-400">Speed</div>
        <div class="mt-2 text-lg font-bold text-gray-900">2–3× faster to production</div>
      </div>
      <div class="py-4 sm:py-0 sm:px-6">
        <div class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-gray-400">Compliance</div>
        <div class="mt-2 text-lg font-bold text-gray-900">Audit-ready from day one</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
